            "author": "chichibekeemedia",
            "region": "BJ",
            "shares": 12,
            "caption": "🎬 Behind the Scenes of Room 307 Creating AI videos isn’t as easy as it looks. For every scene you watch, I often have to generate the same clip multiple times because AI doesn’t always get it right.  Sometimes the characters change, the expressions are wrong, the movements look unnatural, the outfits change, or the scene doesn’t match the story. Every time I regenerate a scene, it uses more AI credits.  Those credits aren’t free—you have to pay for a subscription to access them, and even then, the number of credits is limited.  When AI makes mistakes, you’re forced to use even more of those paid credits just to get one realistic, high-quality scene. If you’ve been following Room 307 from Episode 1 to Episode 8, you’ll notice that I didn’t use those flawed clips.  I took my time to regenerate every scene until it matched the quality and consistency I wanted because I want to give you the best viewing experience possible. It takes patience, countless retries, paid AI credits, days and hours of editing to bring Room 307 and videos to life. If you enjoy this series, please support me by liking, commenting, sharing, and following my page.  Every bit of support means a lot and motivates me to keep creating these stories for you. ❤️🙏 #behindthescenes #room307 #AIstorytelling #contentcreator #Filmmaking",
